{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41955","headline":"海城秋夕寄怀舍弟 · 李中","name":"海城秋夕寄怀舍弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸟栖庭树夜悠悠，枕上谁知泪暗流。\n千里梦魂迷旧业，一城砧杵捣残秋。\n窗闲寂寂灯犹在，帘外萧萧雨未休。\n早晚莱衣同着去，免悲流落在边州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41955.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41955","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}